<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Metal Leve 1996 loss higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Metal Leve 1996 loss higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private autoparts maker Metal Leve sent the following statement to the stock exchanges on its 1996 consolidated results.</p>
<p>				1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Net loss		59.608 million	  21.431 million</p>
<p>    Net revenues	 288.811 million	 334.858 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais. Figures calculated under Brazilian corporate accounting law.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
